config.retrofuturelushcave.cave_generation.tooltip=Settings for underground noise caves, aquifers, and canyons.
config.retrofuturelushcave.underground_features.tooltip=Settings for dripstone, glow lichen, and underwater magma features.
config.retrofuturelushcave.lush_caves.tooltip=Settings for lush cave climate selection and vegetation features.
config.retrofuturelushcave.diagnostics.tooltip=Print debug information in the log, used for troubleshooting world generation issues.

config.retrofuturelushcave.caves.surface_entrance_depth.tooltip=How far below the surface large caves must stay. Only narrow natural entrances can appear above this depth.
config.retrofuturelushcave.caves.entrance_density_threshold.tooltip=Lower this value to make surface cave entrances less common and smaller.
config.retrofuturelushcave.caves.aquifer_minimum_depth.tooltip=How deep a cave must be before underground water can appear. Higher values keep shallow caves dry.
config.retrofuturelushcave.caves.surface_fluid_protection_depth.tooltip=Extra rock kept below rivers, lakes, and oceans. Higher values stop caves from breaking into water.
config.retrofuturelushcave.canyon.probability.tooltip=Chance for a canyon path to begin. Increase carefully; large values create many ravines.
config.retrofuturelushcave.canyon.path_length.tooltip=How far a canyon can travel from its start.
config.retrofuturelushcave.canyon.vertical_scale.tooltip=How tall and deep canyon cuts are. Increase carefully.
config.retrofuturelushcave.lush_caves.vanilla_humidity_threshold.tooltip=Humidity needed for Lush Caves. The default value is 0.70.
config.retrofuturelushcave.lush_caves.minimum_depth.tooltip=Lower limit of the underground climate depth range used by lush and dripstone regions.
config.retrofuturelushcave.lush_caves.maximum_depth.tooltip=Upper limit of the underground climate depth range used by lush and dripstone regions.
config.retrofuturelushcave.dripstone.continentalness_threshold.tooltip=Lower values make dripstone regions more common in the 1.12 noise domain.
config.retrofuturelushcave.dripstone.small_cluster_minimum_attempts.tooltip=Minimum small dripstone-cluster attempts in each chunk.
config.retrofuturelushcave.dripstone.small_cluster_additional_attempts.tooltip=Extra random small dripstone-cluster attempts in each chunk.
config.retrofuturelushcave.dripstone.large_minimum_attempts.tooltip=Minimum large dripstone attempts in each chunk.
config.retrofuturelushcave.dripstone.large_additional_attempts.tooltip=Extra random large dripstone attempts in each chunk.
config.retrofuturelushcave.glow_lichen.minimum_attempts.tooltip=Minimum glow lichen attempts in each chunk.
config.retrofuturelushcave.glow_lichen.additional_attempts.tooltip=Extra random glow lichen attempts in each chunk.
config.retrofuturelushcave.glow_lichen.minimum_ocean_floor_depth.tooltip=Glow lichen must be this far below the ocean floor.
config.retrofuturelushcave.underwater_magma.minimum_attempts.tooltip=Minimum underwater magma attempts in each chunk.
config.retrofuturelushcave.underwater_magma.additional_attempts.tooltip=Extra random underwater magma attempts in each chunk.
config.retrofuturelushcave.underwater_magma.placement_probability.tooltip=Chance for each valid nearby block to become magma.
config.retrofuturelushcave.lush_vegetation.ceiling_attempts.tooltip=Attempts to place moss and plants on lush-cave ceilings.
config.retrofuturelushcave.lush_vegetation.cave_vine_attempts.tooltip=Attempts to place cave vines in lush caves.
config.retrofuturelushcave.lush_vegetation.classic_vine_attempts.tooltip=Attempts to place ordinary vines in lush caves.
config.retrofuturelushcave.lush_vegetation.clay_attempts.tooltip=Attempts to place leaf-covered clay pools in lush caves.
config.retrofuturelushcave.lush_vegetation.floor_attempts.tooltip=Attempts to place moss and plants on lush-cave floors.
config.retrofuturelushcave.lush_vegetation.spore_blossom_attempts.tooltip=Attempts to place spore blossoms in lush caves.
config.retrofuturelushcave.root_system.minimum_tree_attempts.tooltip=Minimum azalea root-system attempts in each chunk.
config.retrofuturelushcave.root_system.additional_tree_attempts.tooltip=Extra random azalea root-system attempts in each chunk.
config.retrofuturelushcave.root_system.maximum_column_height.tooltip=Maximum distance from a successful azalea tree to its cave ceiling.
config.retrofuturelushcave.root_system.hanging_root_attempts.tooltip=Attempts to place hanging roots below a successful azalea root column.
config.retrofuturelushcave.diagnostics.enable_worldgen.tooltip=Writes one aggregate world-generation report after every 128 new chunks. Keep this off for normal play.

